    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have a knack for finding the best quality replacement parts for broken <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a>. Whenever you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Repair\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Repair\">Repair</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> skill, you restore an extra 1d8 Hit Points with a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check, in addition to what you would normally restore.<br><br>If you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> Action to assist an ally with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Repairs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Repairs\">Repairs</a>, that ally also <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Repairs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Repairs\">Repairs</a> an extra 1d8 Hit Points with a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check. Any ally can only benefit from this Talent once per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check, regardless of how many allies with this Talent aid on the check.",
